eaf0a11b91444d4bb7c72.webm?t=1787130272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/850921eac0aeaf0a11b91444d4bb7c72.mp4?t=1787130272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By Breaking and Entering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see something that piques  your curiosity, you can’t help yourself. Break into areas you have no business being, pick locks that your neighbours think will protect their secrets, maybe take an item or two, for evidence of course…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/aa3f864ac77f92e6af0fcec7f663e70b.poster.avif?t=1787130272\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/aa3f864ac77f92e6af0fcec7f663e70b.webm?t=1787130272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/aa3f864ac77f92e6af0fcec7f663e70b.mp4?t=1787130272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>By making your own deductions in classic detective style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re not holding your hands here. You’re the detective, you have the evidence, now how does it connect? We’ll leave that to you to figure out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.poster.avif?t=1787130272\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.webm?t=1787130272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/extras/b4a51085e00ae315facd4941604d8463.mp4?t=1787130272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A young girl’s life is at risk. Wouldn’t you do anything you could to return her to her family?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A child is missing. The police are failing. And you're a retired detective with a bit too much time on your hands. Time to throw out the rules &amp; do whatever it takes to bring the child home. From the developers of I AM RIPPER, The Occupation &amp; Ether One.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Simply one of the best narrative adventure games I’ve played all year, enhanced by fantastic voice acting, well-written dialogue, and an exciting and intriguing story.”<br>9.5/10 – GamePitt<br><br>“If you like tense mysteries and slow-burning thrillers, Conway: Disappearance at Dahlia View really ought to be high on your most-wanted list”<br>9/10 – GameSpew<br><br>“Dahlia View succeeds with its Rear Window-esque voyeurism matching up appropriately to its on-the-ground sleuthing”<br>8/10 – Screen Rant<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/8b2927fcd560089894163002b834f742b3d51d98/header.jpg?t=1787130272", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/f152db7aed82b2261592c9a2331f0b55b899d3b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787130272", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1548750/f152db7aed82b2261592c9a2331f0b55b899d3b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787130272", 